{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowlers is THE bowling simulation. Create your character, experience their adventure, and progress from amateur matches to professional tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in a free game, manage your bag of balls, prove yourself in career mode, become the best player in the world in ranked or online tournaments, and test your skills in the lab\u2014everything is possible in Bowlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all the different bowling alleys available in the game, each with its own type, lanes, and favorite surfaces, from wooden bowling alleys to the latest synthetic bowling alleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters to your liking. Not to mention realistic ball management, where you can modify the drilling, surface, slugs, inserts, and many other customization features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics of bowling, including oil patterns, lane transition, game lines, and everything else there is to know about this sport! Or just have fun with friends, it's your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a bowler, you're a bowler, we're BOWLERS!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681580?t=1758713749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/ba39f0515d7a62a615923998efbeceef20d4c3d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758713749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/3aa22da331ce2676d429da755b4ff08a6887c384/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758713749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/3aa22da331ce2676d429da755b4ff08a6887c384/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758713749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowlers is THE bowling simulation. Create your character, experience their adventure, and progress from amateur matches to professional tournaments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in a free game, manage your bag of balls, prove yourself in career mode, become the best player in the world in ranked or online tournaments, and test your skills in the lab\u2014everything is possible in Bowlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all the different bowling alleys available in the game, each with its own type, lanes, and favorite surfaces, from wooden bowling alleys to the latest synthetic bowling alleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters to your liking. Not to mention realistic ball management, where you can modify the drilling, surface, slugs, inserts, and many other customization features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics of bowling, including oil patterns, lane transition, game lines, and everything else there is to know about this sport! Or just have fun with friends, it's your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a bowler, you're a bowler, we're BOWLERS!</p>","developers":["Solid9Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681580/cc9da4dbafff296b775ffa05f280bfbb53c48a35/header.jpg?t=1758713749","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":